---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="페이지를 찾을 수 없어요">
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-(--container-2xl) flex-col items-center px-md py-3xl text-center">
    <p class="text-6xl font-bold text-muted-foreground/40">404</p>
    <h1 class="mt-md text-xl font-bold">페이지를 찾을 수 없어요</h1>
    <p class="mt-sm text-muted-foreground">주소가 바뀌었거나 삭제된 글이에요. 검색으로 찾아보세요.</p>
    <div class="mt-xl flex gap-sm">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="inline-flex h-10 items-center rounded-md bg-primary px-lg text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground"
      >
        글 목록으로
      </a>
      <button
        type="button"
        data-search-open
        class="inline-flex h-10 items-center rounded-md border border-border px-lg text-sm font-bold"
      >
        검색하기
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
